{
  "id": "section-941",
  "title": "看到西安师院造反派两张大字报和给中央文革的信后的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-321.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>321)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　现在有的人是“铺张闹革命”，“大少爷作风”，“掌权开始，是浪费开始。”如果是人民内部矛盾的话，批评人家宽一些，批评自己严一些。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-320.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-322.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
